# Shell and awk scripts are read by bash and awk on WSL and in the container: keep them LF in the
# working tree whatever core.autocrlf says (a CRLF checkout makes bash read `do\r` as a command, so
# `bash -n` fails). After adding or changing this file: git add --renormalize -- '*.sh' '*.awk'
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.awk text eol=lf
